1
00:00:00,889 --> 00:00:02,589
(Leonard:)rubbing our success
in Sheldon's face.

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:04,760
(Raj:)Oh, well, that's
the best part.
Oh, yeah.

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:09,430
(Bernadette:)Dan, could I talk
to you for a minute?

4
00:00:12,834 --> 00:00:14,834
(Dan:)Sure, go ahead.

5
00:00:14,836 --> 00:00:16,506
(Bernadette:)Just want you to know
I didn't mean

6
00:00:16,504 --> 00:00:17,874
(Bernadette:)to be rude about your grandson.

7
00:00:17,872 --> 00:00:19,402
(Dan:)No, it's okay.

8
00:00:19,407 --> 00:00:21,277
(Sheldon:)No, it's not.

9
00:00:21,276 --> 00:00:23,076
(Bernadette:)Penny told me
that everyone's scared of me.

10
00:00:23,077 --> 00:00:25,277
(laughing):
What? What?

11
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,210
(Dan:)Why would she say that?

12
00:00:27,215 --> 00:00:28,785
(Dan:)You know she drinks, right?

13
00:00:28,783 --> 00:00:30,713
(Bernadette:)What?

14
00:00:30,718 --> 00:00:33,218
(Bernadette:)No, she's right,
and I just want you to know

15
00:00:33,221 --> 00:00:35,451
(Bernadette:)that from now on, I'm gonna be
much more sensitive.

16
00:00:35,456 --> 00:00:37,526
(Bernadette:)I don't want anyone walking
on eggshells around me.

17
00:00:37,525 --> 00:00:40,255
(Dan:)Oh, well, okay, then, uh,

18
00:00:40,261 --> 00:00:42,191
(Dan:)one thing
I've been meaning to tell you

19
00:00:42,196 --> 00:00:44,866
(Dan:)is that the company is gonna
stop paying for our coffee.

20
00:00:44,866 --> 00:00:46,696
(Bernadette:)No problem. When
does that start?

21
00:00:46,701 --> 00:00:48,901
(Dan:)Five months ago.

22
00:00:48,903 --> 00:00:50,303
What?!
Yeah.

23
00:00:50,305 --> 00:00:51,875
(Bernadette:)Who's been paying
for my coffee?

24
00:00:51,873 --> 00:00:52,943
(Dan:)All of us.

25
00:00:52,941 --> 00:00:54,441
(Penny:)Yeah. It comes
from the swear jar

26
00:00:54,442 --> 00:00:56,272
(Penny:)we put money in when you curse.

27
00:00:59,547 --> 00:01:01,447
(Bernadette:)What else don't I know about?

